# Paceloop is a Python project. Keep GitHub's language bar honest by not letting
# the web UI, the Android wrapper, and docs drown out the actual Python code.
# (These are still real files — this only affects the language statistics.)
sprintgpt/templates/**  linguist-vendored
sprintgpt/static/**     linguist-vendored
android/**              linguist-vendored
*.md                    linguist-documentation

# Don't try to diff binaries.
*.apk binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
